TITLE: React Custom Hook with Memoization and Effect
DESCRIPTION: This JavaScript code defines a custom React hook `useFoo`. It uses `React.useMemo` to memoize a function that calls `someGlobal()`, and `useEffect` to execute this memoized function when the component mounts or when the function reference changes. The `FIXTURE_ENTRYPOINT` exports the hook for testing purposes.

