TITLE: Optimize useMakeCallback Hook with React Compiler
DESCRIPTION: This code demonstrates how to optimize a React hook, `useMakeCallback`, using the React compiler runtime. The hook returns a function that sets state based on an object's value. Memoization is used to prevent unnecessary re-creations of the callback, improving performance.

SOURCE: https://github.com/facebook/react/blob/main/compiler/packages/babel-plugin-react-compiler/src/__tests__/fixtures/compiler/inner-function/nullable-objects/assume-invoked/return-function.expect.md#_snippet_0

LANGUAGE: javascript
