TITLE: React Component with Hooks
DESCRIPTION: A functional React component that uses `useDispatch` to get a dispatch function and `useEffect` to call an update function on mount. The `onUpdate` function is memoized using a closure.

SOURCE: https://github.com/facebook/react/blob/main/compiler/packages/babel-plugin-react-compiler/src/__tests__/fixtures/compiler/useEffect-arg-memoized.expect.md#_snippet_0

LANGUAGE: javascript
CODE:
```
function Component(props) {
  const dispatch = useDispatch();
  useFreeze(dispatch);

  // onUpdate should be memoized even though it doesn't
  // flow into the return value
  const onUpdate = () => {
    dispatch({kind: 'update'});
  };

  useEffect(() => {
    onUpdate();
  }, [onUpdate]);

  return <div />;
}
```

